{"seq":2,"slug":"obligation-role-responsibility-matrix","title":"义务主体识别与责任矩阵（生产者/进口商/授权代表）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-regulation-ppwr-sustainability/packaging-regulation-framework/obligation-role-responsibility-matrix","wordCount":2811,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"义务主体识别与责任矩阵-生产者-进口商-授权代表\">义务主体识别与责任矩阵（生产者/进口商/授权代表）</h1><p>一批从义乌发出、经德国海外仓卖给欧盟消费者的 PET 饮料瓶包装，在 PPWR 语境下同时对应四张面孔：品牌持有方（中国公司）、目的国进口商、平台卖家账号、以及被要求指定的授权代表。但登记册里只有一个&quot;生产者&quot;（Producer）位子——认错这一个，注册号挂到错误主体上，EPR 缴费与申报全部落空，而这一切发生在货已经卖出去之后。</p>\n<p>义务主体识别不是法务文书工作，而是<strong>每上一个新市场的准入前置</strong>。它的产物是一条可核验记录：<code>SKU → 目的国 → 责任主体 → 注册号</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-ppwr-把-生产者-定义为投放入市场的行为\">核心概念：PPWR 把&quot;生产者&quot;定义为投放入市场的行为</h2><p>欧盟包装与包装废弃物法规 <strong>Regulation (EU) 2025/40（PPWR）</strong> 于 <strong>2025 年 2 月 11 日生效</strong>，自 <strong>2026 年 8 月 12 日</strong>起适用，同日基本废止旧的 <strong>Directive 94/62/EC</strong>（<a href=\"https://environment.ec.europa.eu/topics/waste-and-recycling/packaging-waste_en\">European Commission — Packaging and packaging waste</a>）。它最直接改变跨境电商的地方，是&quot;谁算生产者&quot;由<strong>把包装或包装商品投放到成员国市场</strong>这一行为触发，而不是由品牌归属触发。</p>\n<p>这意味着三件反直觉的事：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>进口即生产。</strong> 谁把包装商品从一个成员国境外带入目的国市场，谁就在那一刻成为生产者；中国出口商一旦通过自有渠道直邮给终端消费者，身份就从&quot;出口商&quot;变成目的国生产者。</li>\n<li><strong>一次商品可能产生多个生产者。</strong> 品牌方与进口商若同时在目的国投放，两者需协商由谁注册，另一方保留分销商或供货方身份。</li>\n<li><strong>主体识别先于一切申报。</strong> PPWR 的 EPR 义务、注册、报告、回收融资都挂在&quot;生产者&quot;这一个主键上，主键错了，下游全错。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>识别顺序可以固定成一条决策链，避免每次上新都重新争论：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  SKU[SKU 拟投放目的国] --&gt; Q1{在目的国有&lt;br/&gt;注册实体吗}&#10;  Q1 --&gt;|有| Q2{以自有品牌&lt;br/&gt;投放市场吗}&#10;  Q1 --&gt;|无| Q3{通过当地进口商&lt;br/&gt;还是直销终端}&#10;  Q2 --&gt;|是| P1[当地实体 = 生产者]&#10;  Q2 --&gt;|否| P2[进口商 / 品牌方 = 生产者]&#10;  Q3 --&gt;|经进口商| P3[进口商 = 生产者]&#10;  Q3 --&gt;|跨境直邮 D2C| P4{是否需要&lt;br/&gt;授权代表}&#10;  P4 --&gt;|需要| P5[生产者 + 授权代表]&#10;  P4 --&gt;|豁免 / 暂停| P6[生产者自行注册]&#10;  P1 --&gt; REG[取得目的国生产者注册号]&#10;  P2 --&gt; REG&#10;  P3 --&gt; REG&#10;  P5 --&gt; REG&#10;  P6 --&gt; REG&#10;  REG --&gt; OBL[注册 / 申报 / 回收费分摊]\">graph TD\n  SKU[SKU 拟投放目的国] --&gt; Q1{在目的国有&lt;br/&gt;注册实体吗}\n  Q1 --&gt;|有| Q2{以自有品牌&lt;br/&gt;投放市场吗}\n  Q1 --&gt;|无| Q3{通过当地进口商&lt;br/&gt;还是直销终端}\n  Q2 --&gt;|是| P1[当地实体 = 生产者]\n  Q2 --&gt;|否| P2[进口商 / 品牌方 = 生产者]\n  Q3 --&gt;|经进口商| P3[进口商 = 生产者]\n  Q3 --&gt;|跨境直邮 D2C| P4{是否需要&lt;br/&gt;授权代表}\n  P4 --&gt;|需要| P5[生产者 + 授权代表]\n  P4 --&gt;|豁免 / 暂停| P6[生产者自行注册]\n  P1 --&gt; REG[取得目的国生产者注册号]\n  P2 --&gt; REG\n  P3 --&gt; REG\n  P5 --&gt; REG\n  P6 --&gt; REG\n  REG --&gt; OBL[注册 / 申报 / 回收费分摊]</pre><p>链条上最容易漏的是最后一跳：<strong>取得注册号 ≠ 义务履行完毕</strong>。注册只解决&quot;身份登记&quot;，定期申报（投放市场的包装数量与重量）与回收融资是独立的持续义务，在几乎每个成员国都是单独的可处罚项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三类主体-生产者-进口商与分销商\">三类主体：生产者、进口商与分销商</h2><p>跨境链条上的角色不止&quot;生产者&quot;一个，把每个角色对应到具体义务，才能判断谁该干什么、谁可以委托谁。下表以 PPWR 与德国 VerpackG、英国 pEPR 的共性为准，具体成员国细则仍需单独核对：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>主体角色</th>\n<th>典型身份</th>\n<th>核心义务</th>\n<th>可否转移</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生产者 Producer</td>\n<td>品牌方 / 进口商 / 直销卖家</td>\n<td>在 EPR 登记册注册、定期申报包装数量与重量、参与回收融资</td>\n<td>可委托授权代表办理注册</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进口商 Importer</td>\n<td>目的国境内买断货权方</td>\n<td>作为投放市场行为主体承担生产者义务</td>\n<td>不可转移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分销商 Distributor</td>\n<td>零售商 / 电商卖家</td>\n<td>提供必要信息、配合回收渠道</td>\n<td>不可转移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>授权代表 Authorised Representative</td>\n<td>目的国境内受托实体</td>\n<td>代非境内生产者履行注册与申报</td>\n<td>本身不是义务源头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>履约 / 海外仓 Fulfilment</td>\n<td>3PL、仓储运营方</td>\n<td>通常无包装 EPR 义务，但为监管举证提供数据</td>\n<td>不承担生产者义务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两个实操要点：<strong>授权代表只搬运义务、不消灭义务</strong>——境外生产者仍对申报数据的真实性负责；<strong>同一款产品在不同国家触发的主体可能不同</strong>，因为各国对&quot;投放入市场&quot;的表述与登记册设计并不一致。</p>\n<p>德国是极端案例。德国包装法规 <strong>VerpackG</strong> 要求任何&quot;在德国分销带包装商品&quot;的一方在 <strong>LUCID 包装登记册（Zentrale Stelle Verpackungsregister, ZSVR）</strong> 注册，并声明品牌名；境外公司若无德国营业场所，通常须<strong>指定一名境内授权代表</strong>（Bevollmächtigter）才能完成注册与申报（<a href=\"https://www.verpackungsregister.org/en/\">ZSVR / LUCID</a>）。ZSVR 明确提示：&quot;注册本身对某些包装类型并不足够&quot;——系统参与（System Participation）与完整性声明（Decleration of Completeness）是注册之外的独立义务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"授权代表-义务的搬运工与它的暂停提案\">授权代表：义务的搬运工与它的暂停提案</h2><p>授权代表是 PPWR 针对<strong>跨境直邮</strong>场景设计的机制：非境内的生产者在自己没有营业场所的成员国，须指定一名在该国有营业场所的授权代表，由其代为履行注册与申报。这一义务的法律依据是 <strong>PPWR 第 45 条</strong>，其第 3 款正是外界所称的&quot;授权代表强制&quot;条款。</p>\n<p>这里有一个 2026 年的关键变量。2025 年 12 月，欧盟委员会在**环境综合简化包（Environmental Omnibus）**中提案，<strong>暂停</strong>生产者就&quot;跨境直销给消费者&quot;指定授权代表的义务，理由是&quot;降低小企业的行政负担与成本&quot;；若该提案 <strong>COM(2025) 982</strong> 获通过，暂停将延续至 <strong>2035 年 1 月 1 日</strong>（<a href=\"https://environment.ec.europa.eu/topics/waste-and-recycling/packaging-waste_en\">European Commission — Packaging and packaging waste</a>）。截至该页面最近一次核对（2026 年 9 月），提案仍在欧洲议会与理事会审议中，<strong>尚未成为可依赖的豁免</strong>。</p>\n<p>对跨境卖家的操作含义因此是分叉的：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>不应把暂停提案当作豁免来排期。</strong> 它是提案，不是已生效的法律；PPWR 本身自 2026 年 8 月 12 日已适用，第 45 条仍在其中。</li>\n<li><strong>应把&quot;是否需要授权代表&quot;做成按国开关的配置。</strong> 德国无论提案结果如何都要求境外公司指定境内授权代表；提案若通过，只影响它覆盖的那部分成员国与场景，不会推翻成员国的既有登记册规则。</li>\n<li><strong>授权代表的合同必须写清数据责任。</strong> 代表代为提交，但申报数据的真实性由生产者承担——这条在 PPWR 与各国法规里是一致的。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"注册与申报-义务落到登记册的实操\">注册与申报：义务落到登记册的实操</h2><p>识别完主体，剩下三件事：<strong>在哪注册、按什么申报、费用怎么分</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>注册。</strong> PPWR 要求生产者进入成员国的生产者登记册（EPR register），欧盟层面推动各登记册之间的格式与数据互通。德国走 LUCID（<a href=\"https://www.verpackungsregister.org/en/\">ZSVR / LUCID</a>）；英国由 <strong>PackUK</strong> 作为 pEPR 的 scheme administrator 统一管理注册与收费（<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/collections/extended-producer-responsibility-for-packaging\">GOV.UK — Extended producer responsibility for packaging</a>）。注册号是与监管通信的唯一主键，必须写进商品详情或随附文件——它也是平台核验卖家合规状态的抓取对象。</p>\n<p><strong>申报。</strong> 生产者须定期上报投放市场的包装数量与重量，且<strong>按材料类别分列</strong>（纸/塑料/金属/玻璃等），因为回收费率按材料与重量差异极大。英国的大生产者须<strong>每 6 个月报告一次包装数据、每年向监管机构注册一次</strong>，并保留数据 <strong>7 年</strong>；小生产者须每年注册，并在<strong>每年 4 月 1 日前</strong>完成注册续期与数据报告（<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/collections/extended-producer-responsibility-for-packaging\">GOV.UK</a>）。这个&quot;4 月 1 日&quot;是跨境卖家最容易错过的硬时点。</p>\n<p><strong>费用分摊。</strong> 多家主体共存时，生产者责任组织（PRO）通常按<strong>投放到市场的包装重量份额</strong>分摊集体回收成本。单个生产者的分摊比例为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_i = \\frac{W_i}{\\sum_{j=1}^{n} W_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4904em;vertical-align:-1.1301em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3057em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1301em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个生产者当期投放市场的包装重量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_j W_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该国该材料类别的总投放重量。生态调节系数（eco-modulation）进一步修正实际年费：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>collection</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_i = S_i \\times C_{\\text{collection}} \\times (1 + m_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">collection</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>collection</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{collection}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">collection</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该国该类别当年集体回收总成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是可回收设计的调节系数——易回收、单一材料的包装 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_i &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，难回收的复合包装 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_i &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>。这解释了为什么&quot;申报重量准确&quot;直接等于&quot;费用不虚高&quot;：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 报错，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就错，年度对账时必然暴露。</p>\n<h2 id=\"责任矩阵-把主体识别做成-sku-目的国的格子\">责任矩阵：把主体识别做成 SKU × 目的国的格子</h2><p>同一款产品在多个市场同时销售时，真正的复杂度不是&quot;识别哪个主体&quot;，而是&quot;多套义务的时序对齐&quot;。建议把合规做成一张<strong>矩阵而非清单</strong>——行是 SKU 或产品族，列是目的国，单元格填注册号、责任主体与申报状态。清单会随市场增加而失效，矩阵不会。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目的国 / 机制</th>\n<th>责任主体触发点</th>\n<th>授权代表要求</th>\n<th>关键申报时点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>德国（VerpackG / LUCID）</td>\n<td>在德分销带包装商品即触发</td>\n<td>无境内营业场所须指定 Bevollmächtigter</td>\n<td>按系统参与与完整性声明周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>英国（pEPR / PackUK）</td>\n<td>供应或进口包装/包装商品</td>\n<td>制度内不单独设代表</td>\n<td>大生产者每 6 个月报告；小生产者每年 4 月 1 日前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧盟通用（PPWR 2025/40）</td>\n<td>包装或包装商品投放成员国市场</td>\n<td>第 45 条（第 45(3) 暂停提案待审议）</td>\n<td>自 2026-08-12 起适用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>时间轴同样需要校准。PPWR 并非一次性生效，而是<strong>分阶段落地</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>日期</th>\n<th>事项</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2025-02-11</td>\n<td>PPWR 生效</td>\n<td>已生效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2026-08-12</td>\n<td>法规开始适用；旧指令 94/62/EC 基本废止</td>\n<td>已适用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2026-08-12</td>\n<td>重金属限值与 PFAS 限值适用；包装须设计为可回收</td>\n<td>已适用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2028-08-12</td>\n<td>统一材料标签（或相关实施法案后 24 个月）</td>\n<td>条件性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2030-01-01</td>\n<td>再生含量要求；可回收性性能等级 C</td>\n<td>条件性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个反复出现的坑：<strong>注册号的有效期与申报周期并不同步</strong>。注册号可能在年内有效，但申报窗口是每 6 个月或每年——卖家帐号里的注册号&quot;看着没过期&quot;，申报却已逾期。把两者分别建提醒，是跨境合规运营的基本功。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>PPWR（Regulation (EU) 2025/40）自 2026 年 8 月 12 日起适用</strong>，&quot;生产者&quot;由投放市场的行为定义，不由品牌归属定义。</li>\n<li><strong>进口即生产</strong>：把包装商品带入目的国市场的一方即为生产者；一次商品可能产生多个生产者，需协商注册主体。</li>\n<li><strong>授权代表是第 45 条的机制</strong>（核心是 45(3)）；2025 年 12 月的环境综合简化包拟将其暂停至 2035-01-01（提案 <strong>COM(2025) 982</strong>），截至 2026 年 9 月仍在审议，<strong>不能当作豁免排期</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>授权代表只搬运义务、不消灭义务</strong>，申报数据的真实性始终由生产者负责；德国要求无境内营业场所者指定 Bevollmächtigter。</li>\n<li><strong>费用按投放重量份额分摊</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_i = W_i / \\sum_j W_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，再乘生态调节系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；申报重量直接决定钱包。</li>\n<li><strong>申报时点是硬约束</strong>：英国大生产者每 6 个月报告、小生产者每年 4 月 1 日前注册续期；注册号有效期与申报周期不同步，须分别设提醒。</li>\n<li><strong>把合规做成矩阵</strong>（SKU × 目的国 → 主体 / 注册号 / 申报状态），而非一次性清单。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"义务主体识别与责任矩阵（生产者/进口商/授权代表）","id":"义务主体识别与责任矩阵-生产者-进口商-授权代表"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：PPWR 把\"生产者\"定义为投放入市场的行为","id":"核心概念-ppwr-把-生产者-定义为投放入市场的行为"},{"level":2,"text":"三类主体：生产者、进口商与分销商","id":"三类主体-生产者-进口商与分销商"},{"level":2,"text":"授权代表：义务的搬运工与它的暂停提案","id":"授权代表-义务的搬运工与它的暂停提案"},{"level":2,"text":"注册与申报：义务落到登记册的实操","id":"注册与申报-义务落到登记册的实操"},{"level":2,"text":"责任矩阵：把主体识别做成 SKU × 目的国的格子","id":"责任矩阵-把主体识别做成-sku-目的国的格子"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"PPWR 适用范围、关键定义与实施时间表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-regulation-ppwr-sustainability/packaging-regulation-framework/ppwr-scope-applicability-timeline"},"next":{"title":"多法域法规叠加与冲突优先级处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-regulation-ppwr-sustainability/packaging-regulation-framework/multi-jurisdiction-overlap-conflict"}}